40), then to the DAW - Ableton Live, through desired effects and\/or to be stored on the hard drive, back to the sound card and out to a PA-system. Sound engineers usually treat my drums as\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"signal-flow","src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2011\/09\/41.gif?fit=586%2C476&ssl=1&resize=350%2C200","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]},{"id":940,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2012\/02\/15\/testing-sensor-system-on-a-dancer-day-2\/","url_meta":{"origin":21,"position":3},"title":"Testing sensor system on a dancer &#8211; day 2","date":"February 15, 2012","format":false,"excerpt":"What: I will test Eowave\u2019s Eobody2 HF on a dancer. Why: I want to see if this system works with our project. How: I will have the sensors control simple parameters. -------- After the first day we met I made some enhancements to the setup. If anyone is interested, this\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2013\/05\/p940.jpg?fit=1200%2C675&ssl=1&resize=350%2C200","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]},{"id":362,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2011\/10\/25\/project-description\/","url_meta":{"origin":21,"position":4},"title":"Project description","date":"October 25, 2011","format":false,"excerpt":"Project description: Performance with realtime interaction between drums and electronics. Goal: To develop a setup with drums and electronics which shall be practical and easy to operate. Why I do this: Amongst guitarists and some what keyboard players, the integration of audio processing and the interaction between the instrument and\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"","width":0,"height":0},"classes":[]},{"id":31,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2011\/09\/13\/processing\/","url_meta":{"origin":21,"positi